{"nodes": [{"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_md", "label": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "source_location": "L1"}, {"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_1_core_principles", "label": "1. Core Principles", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "source_location": "L3"}, {"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_one_file_owns_each_rule_no_duplication_if_a_rule_exists_in_two_places_you_have_two_sources_of_truth_which_means_you_have_none", "label": "One file owns each rule. No duplication. If a rule exists in two places, you have two sources of truth, which means you have none.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "source_location": "L4"}, {"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_read_before_acting_the_agent_must_read_agent_md_at_the_start_of_every_session_to_establish_context_for_deeper_tasks_the_agent_must_look_up_the_relevant_files_from_the_registry", "label": "Read before acting. The agent must read agent.md at the start of every session to establish context. For deeper tasks, the agent must look up the relevant files from the registry.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "source_location": "L6"}, {"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_update_only_on_request_the_agent_will_register_new_files_enforce_ownership_and_keep_the_registry_accurate_only_when_the_human_explicitly_requests_a_doc_sweep_after_approving_code_changes", "label": "Update only on request. The agent will register new files, enforce ownership, and keep the registry accurate only when the human explicitly requests a \"doc sweep\" after approving code changes.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LIVING_DOC_SYSTEM.md", "source_location": "L8"}, {"id": "users_diviyanshmodi_downloads_psyche_living_doc_system_the_human_checkpoint_is_the_system_